DESCRIPTION:Be there early for discussion and maybe snacks. Doors open at 5
 :30.<br><br>We will journey together using a symphony of sacred instruments
 \, including but not limited to crystal singing bowls\, a small gong\, drum
 s\, and chimes. We will start with some movement then move into mantras and
  breath then everyone settles in to experience the instruments. These tools
  create a powerful\, immersive soundscape that helps to detoxify the system
  of excess energy\, stress\, and mental chatter. If you sometimes find it h
 ard to make space for yourself and find inner silence\, join us for an oppo
 rtunity in a community where that's the shared goal.<br><br>Be sure to brin
 g a mat and a blanket or a beach towel and some blankets or some blankets a
 nd some more blankets... Bring things to be cozy with haha. A pillow and so
 me tea/ water also help.<br>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260324T143014Z
LOCATION:7515 Delwood Rd NW
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Community Sound Bath
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT


