 he focus is on video games\, but there are lots of other cool collectibles
 present. There are over 60 vendors.<br><br>Admission is free.<br><br>A fun
 activity for us nerds to meet up and check out the vendors\, and maybe meet
  other fellow nerds. This is an independently organized event that we will
 attend as a group.<br><br><a href="https://yegnerdsale.com">https://yegnerd
 sale.com</a><br><br>Crossposted to: YEG30+/Y3P Discord Group.<br><br>DISCLA
